{"seq":3,"slug":"editorconfig","title":"EditorConfig 与编辑器统一配置","url":"/l-doc-books/h/editors-compilers/code-formatting-linting/formatting-principles/editorconfig","wordCount":1397,"readingTime":6,"html":"<h1 id=\"editorconfig-与编辑器统一配置\">EditorConfig 与编辑器统一配置</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>EditorConfig 是一个跨编辑器、跨 IDE 的代码风格配置标准。它解决的核心问题是：<strong>当团队成员使用不同的编辑器时，如何确保基础的文件格式（缩进、换行符、字符编码等）保持一致</strong>。EditorConfig 不是代码格式化工具，而是编辑器行为的统一配置层。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    A[.editorconfig 文件] --&gt; B{编辑器加载}&#10;    B --&gt; C[VS Code]&#10;    B --&gt; D[JetBrains IDE]&#10;    B --&gt; E[Vim/Neovim]&#10;    B --&gt; F[Sublime Text]&#10;    C --&gt; G[统一缩进风格]&#10;    D --&gt; G&#10;    E --&gt; G&#10;    F --&gt; G&#10;    G --&gt; H[文件保存时应用]\">flowchart TD\n    A[.editorconfig 文件] --&gt; B{编辑器加载}\n    B --&gt; C[VS Code]\n    B --&gt; D[JetBrains IDE]\n    B --&gt; E[Vim/Neovim]\n    B --&gt; F[Sublime Text]\n    C --&gt; G[统一缩进风格]\n    D --&gt; G\n    E --&gt; G\n    F --&gt; G\n    G --&gt; H[文件保存时应用]</pre><p>EditorConfig 与其他格式化方案的定位区别：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>维度</th>\n<th>EditorConfig</th>\n<th>Prettier</th>\n<th>ESLint</th>\n<th>IDE 内置设置</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>作用范围</td>\n<td>文件级基础格式</td>\n<td>代码完整重写</td>\n<td>规则检查与修复</td>\n<td>编辑器全局</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>配置粒度</td>\n<td>缩进、换行、编码</td>\n<td>语法级格式化</td>\n<td>AST 级规则</td>\n<td>编辑器偏好</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>跨编辑器</td>\n<td>原生支持</td>\n<td>需插件</td>\n<td>需插件</td>\n<td>不跨编辑器</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>版本管理</td>\n<td>.editorconfig 入库</td>\n<td>.prettierrc 入库</td>\n<td>eslint.config 入库</td>\n<td>settings.json 个人</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>学习成本</td>\n<td>极低</td>\n<td>低</td>\n<td>中高</td>\n<td>低</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>适用语言</td>\n<td>所有文本文件</td>\n<td>JS/TS/CSS/HTML 等</td>\n<td>JS/TS 为主</td>\n<td>取决于编辑器</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>EditorConfig 的核心价值是<strong>最小公约数</strong>——它只管最基础、最通用、所有编辑器都能理解的格式属性。</p>\n<h2 id=\"配置语法与属性详解\">配置语法与属性详解</h2><p><code>.editorconfig</code> 使用 INI 风格的语法，通过文件匹配模式（glob）为不同类型的文件指定不同的格式属性。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"ini\" data-code=\"root = true&#10;&#10;[*]&#10;charset = utf-8&#10;end_of_line = lf&#10;indent_style = space&#10;indent_size = 2&#10;insert_final_newline = true&#10;trim_trailing_whitespace = true&#10;&#10;[*.md]&#10;trim_trailing_whitespace = false&#10;&#10;[*.{yaml,yml}]&#10;indent_size = 2&#10;&#10;[*.go]&#10;indent_style = tab&#10;&#10;[Makefile]&#10;indent_style = tab&#10;&#10;[*.{json,jsonc}]&#10;indent_size = 2&#10;insert_final_newline = true&#10;&#10;[*.py]&#10;indent_size = 4\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>root = true</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>[*]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>charset = utf-8</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>end_of_line = lf</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>indent_style = space</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>indent_size = 2</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>insert_final_newline = true</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>trim_trailing_whitespace = true</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>[*.md]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>trim_trailing_whitespace = false</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>[*.{yaml,yml}]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>indent_size = 2</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>[*.go]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>indent_style = tab</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>[Makefile]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>indent_style = tab</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>[*.{json,jsonc}]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>indent_size = 2</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>insert_final_newline = true</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>[*.py]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>indent_size = 4</span></span></code></pre></div><p>每个属性的含义与适用场景：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>属性</th>\n<th>可选值</th>\n<th>默认行为</th>\n<th>作用说明</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>root</td>\n<td>true/false</td>\n<td>false</td>\n<td>标记为顶层配置，停止向上查找</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>charset</td>\n<td>utf-8 / utf-8-bom / latin1</td>\n<td>编辑器默认</td>\n<td>文件字符编码</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>end_of_line</td>\n<td>lf / crlf / cr</td>\n<td>系统默认</td>\n<td>换行符类型</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>indent_style</td>\n<td>space / tab</td>\n<td>编辑器默认</td>\n<td>缩进字符类型</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>indent_size</td>\n<td>数字 / tab</td>\n<td>编辑器默认</td>\n<td>缩进宽度</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>tab_width</td>\n<td>数字</td>\n<td>indent_size</td>\n<td>Tab 显示宽度</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>trim_trailing_whitespace</td>\n<td>true / false</td>\n<td>false</td>\n<td>保存时去除行尾空白</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>insert_final_newline</td>\n<td>true / false</td>\n<td>false</td>\n<td>文件末尾确保空行</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>max_line_length</td>\n<td>数字 / off</td>\n<td>off</td>\n<td>建议最大行宽</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><code>root = true</code> 是一个关键属性。EditorConfig 的查找机制是<strong>从当前文件向上遍历目录树</strong>，合并所有找到的 <code>.editorconfig</code> 文件，直到遇到 <code>root = true</code> 或到达文件系统根目录。这种机制支持 monorepo 中不同子项目使用不同配置。</p>\n<h2 id=\"文件匹配与优先级机制\">文件匹配与优先级机制</h2><p>EditorConfig 使用类似 glob 的模式匹配语法，支持通配符和花括号展开：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"ini\" data-code=\"[*]              # 匹配所有文件&#10;[*.js]           # 匹配所有 .js 文件&#10;[*.{ts,tsx}]     # 匹配 .ts 和 .tsx 文件&#10;[lib/**.js]      # 匹配 lib 目录下所有 .js 文件&#10;[{package.json,.travis.yml}]  # 匹配特定文件名\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>[*]              # 匹配所有文件</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>[*.js]           # 匹配所有 .js 文件</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>[*.{ts,tsx}]     # 匹配 .ts 和 .tsx 文件</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>[lib/**.js]      # 匹配 lib 目录下所有 .js 文件</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>[{package.json,.travis.yml}]  # 匹配特定文件名</span></span></code></pre></div><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    A[打开文件 src/utils/helper.ts] --&gt; B[查找当前目录 .editorconfig]&#10;    B --&gt; C{找到?}&#10;    C --&gt;|是| D[读取配置]&#10;    C --&gt;|否| E[向上一级目录查找]&#10;    D --&gt; F{root = true?}&#10;    F --&gt;|否| E&#10;    F --&gt;|是| G[停止查找]&#10;    E --&gt; B&#10;    G --&gt; H[合并所有匹配的配置段]&#10;    H --&gt; I[应用到编辑器]\">flowchart TD\n    A[打开文件 src/utils/helper.ts] --&gt; B[查找当前目录 .editorconfig]\n    B --&gt; C{找到?}\n    C --&gt;|是| D[读取配置]\n    C --&gt;|否| E[向上一级目录查找]\n    D --&gt; F{root = true?}\n    F --&gt;|否| E\n    F --&gt;|是| G[停止查找]\n    E --&gt; B\n    G --&gt; H[合并所有匹配的配置段]\n    H --&gt; I[应用到编辑器]</pre><p>优先级规则遵循两个原则：</p>\n<p><strong>同一文件内</strong>：后出现的段覆盖先出现的段。如果 <code>[*]</code> 和 <code>[*.ts]</code> 都匹配了一个 <code>.ts</code> 文件，且 <code>[*.ts]</code> 在 <code>[*]</code> 之后，那么 <code>[*.ts]</code> 的属性会覆盖 <code>[*]</code> 中同名属性。</p>\n<p><strong>跨文件</strong>：距离文件越近的 <code>.editorconfig</code> 优先级越高。子目录的配置覆盖父目录的配置。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"interface EditorConfigResolution {&#10;  filePath: string;&#10;  configs: Array&lt;{&#10;    source: string;&#10;    distance: number;&#10;    properties: Record&lt;string, string&gt;;&#10;  }&gt;;&#10;  resolved: Record&lt;string, string&gt;;&#10;}&#10;&#10;function resolveConfig(filePath: string): Record&lt;string, string&gt; {&#10;  const configs = findAllConfigs(filePath);&#10;  const merged: Record&lt;string, string&gt; = {};&#10;&#10;  for (const config of configs.reverse()) {&#10;    for (const section of config.sections) {&#10;      if (matchesGlob(filePath, section.pattern)) {&#10;        Object.assign(merged, section.properties);&#10;      }&#10;    }&#10;  }&#10;&#10;  return merged;&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">interface</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> EditorConfigResolution</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  filePath</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  configs</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Array</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    source</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    distance</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    properties</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Record</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">>;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }>;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  resolved</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Record</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">>;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">function</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> resolveConfig</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">filePath</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Record</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> configs</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> findAllConfigs</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(filePath);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> merged</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Record</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">> </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {};</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  for</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> config</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> of</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> configs.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">reverse</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">()) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    for</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> section</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> of</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> config.sections) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">      if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">matchesGlob</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(filePath, section.pattern)) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        Object.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">assign</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(merged, section.properties);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> merged;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"与-prettier-和-eslint-的协同\">与 Prettier 和 ESLint 的协同</h2><p>EditorConfig 与 Prettier、ESLint 之间存在属性重叠。理解三者的协同关系对于避免配置冲突至关重要。</p>\n<p><strong>Prettier 读取 EditorConfig</strong>：Prettier 默认会读取 <code>.editorconfig</code> 中的 <code>indent_style</code>、<code>indent_size</code>、<code>end_of_line</code> 和 <code>max_line_length</code>，并将它们作为格式化选项的底层默认值。<code>.prettierrc</code> 中的同名选项会覆盖 EditorConfig 的值。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"const configPrecedence = {&#10;  editorconfig: {&#10;    indent_style: &#39;space&#39;,&#10;    indent_size: 2,&#10;    end_of_line: &#39;lf&#39;,&#10;    max_line_length: 80,&#10;  },&#10;  prettierrc: {&#10;    tabWidth: 2,&#10;    useTabs: false,&#10;    endOfLine: &#39;lf&#39;,&#10;    printWidth: 100,&#10;  },&#10;};\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> configPrecedence</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  editorconfig: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    indent_style: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'space'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    indent_size: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">2</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    end_of_line: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'lf'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    max_line_length: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">80</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  prettierrc: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    tabWidth: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">2</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    useTabs: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">false</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    endOfLine: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'lf'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    printWidth: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">100</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">};</span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong>ESLint 不读取 EditorConfig</strong>：ESLint 的缩进规则 (<code>indent</code>) 和换行规则 (<code>linebreak-style</code>) 需要独立配置。当同时使用 EditorConfig 和 ESLint 时，必须确保两者的缩进设置一致。</p>\n<p>最佳实践是建立清晰的分工：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>职责</th>\n<th>工具</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>基础文件格式（缩进、换行、编码）</td>\n<td>EditorConfig</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>代码语法级格式化（括号、逗号、空格）</td>\n<td>Prettier</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>代码质量和最佳实践</td>\n<td>ESLint / Biome</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>编辑器个人偏好（字体、主题）</td>\n<td>IDE settings（不入库）</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"monorepo-场景下的配置策略\">Monorepo 场景下的配置策略</h2><p>在 monorepo 项目中，不同子包可能使用不同的语言和风格约定。EditorConfig 的目录层级机制天然适配这种场景。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"ini\" data-code=\"# 根目录 .editorconfig&#10;root = true&#10;&#10;[*]&#10;charset = utf-8&#10;end_of_line = lf&#10;insert_final_newline = true&#10;trim_trailing_whitespace = true&#10;indent_style = space&#10;indent_size = 2\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span># 根目录 .editorconfig</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>root = true</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>[*]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>charset = utf-8</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>end_of_line = lf</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>insert_final_newline = true</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>trim_trailing_whitespace = true</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>indent_style = space</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>indent_size = 2</span></span></code></pre></div><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"ini\" data-code=\"# packages/backend/.editorconfig（Go 项目）&#10;[*.go]&#10;indent_style = tab&#10;indent_size = 4&#10;&#10;[Makefile]&#10;indent_style = tab\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span># packages/backend/.editorconfig（Go 项目）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>[*.go]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>indent_style = tab</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>indent_size = 4</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>[Makefile]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>indent_style = tab</span></span></code></pre></div><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"ini\" data-code=\"# packages/mobile/.editorconfig（Swift 项目）&#10;[*.swift]&#10;indent_size = 4\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span># packages/mobile/.editorconfig（Swift 项目）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>[*.swift]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>indent_size = 4</span></span></code></pre></div><p>这种层级配置避免了在根目录放置一个庞大的 <code>.editorconfig</code>，每个子项目只需关注自己特有的格式差异。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"interface MonorepoEditorConfig {&#10;  root: {&#10;    common: &#39;utf-8 + lf + space:2&#39;;&#10;    overrides: &#39;md: no trim whitespace&#39;;&#10;  };&#10;  packages: {&#10;    frontend: &#39;继承根配置&#39;;&#10;    backend: &#39;go: tab, makefile: tab&#39;;&#10;    mobile: &#39;swift: space:4&#39;;&#10;    docs: &#39;md: no trim whitespace&#39;;&#10;  };&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">interface</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> MonorepoEditorConfig</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  root</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    common</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'utf-8 + lf + space:2'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    overrides</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'md: no trim whitespace'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  };</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  packages</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    frontend</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> '继承根配置'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    backend</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'go: tab, makefile: tab'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    mobile</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'swift: space:4'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    docs</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'md: no trim whitespace'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  };</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p>一个常见的陷阱是：子目录的 <code>.editorconfig</code> 如果设置了 <code>root = true</code>，则会阻止该目录下的文件继承父目录配置。在 monorepo 中通常不应在子包中设置 <code>root = true</code>，除非子包确实需要完全独立的配置。</p>\n<h2 id=\"ide-原生支持与插件生态\">IDE 原生支持与插件生态</h2><p>EditorConfig 的广泛采用得益于主流编辑器的原生或插件支持：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>编辑器/IDE</th>\n<th>支持方式</th>\n<th>备注</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>VS Code</td>\n<td>内置支持（v1.0+）</td>\n<td>无需安装额外扩展</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>JetBrains 系列</td>\n<td>内置支持</td>\n<td>WebStorm、IntelliJ 等</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Vim/Neovim</td>\n<td>插件 editorconfig-vim</td>\n<td>需手动安装</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Sublime Text</td>\n<td>插件 EditorConfig</td>\n<td>Package Control 安装</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Emacs</td>\n<td>插件 editorconfig-emacs</td>\n<td>MELPA 安装</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Xcode</td>\n<td>不支持</td>\n<td>需借助其他工具</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Visual Studio</td>\n<td>内置支持（2017+）</td>\n<td>.NET 项目常用</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>VS Code 中 EditorConfig 的工作机制：当文件被打开时，VS Code 会查找匹配的 <code>.editorconfig</code> 配置，并将相关属性应用到编辑器的工作区设置中。这意味着 <code>indent_size</code> 会覆盖 <code>editor.tabSize</code>，<code>indent_style</code> 会覆盖 <code>editor.insertSpaces</code>。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart LR&#10;    A[.editorconfig] --&gt; B[VS Code 配置层]&#10;    C[settings.json] --&gt; B&#10;    D[工作区设置] --&gt; B&#10;    B --&gt; E{优先级合并}&#10;    E --&gt; F[EditorConfig 最高]&#10;    F --&gt; G[编辑器实际行为]\">flowchart LR\n    A[.editorconfig] --&gt; B[VS Code 配置层]\n    C[settings.json] --&gt; B\n    D[工作区设置] --&gt; B\n    B --&gt; E{优先级合并}\n    E --&gt; F[EditorConfig 最高]\n    F --&gt; G[编辑器实际行为]</pre><p>需要注意的是，EditorConfig 只影响<strong>新输入的内容</strong>和<strong>保存时的处理</strong>，它不会主动重新格式化已有的代码。如果需要将已有文件统一为 EditorConfig 指定的格式，仍需配合 Prettier 等格式化工具执行全量格式化。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"mindmap\" data-source=\"mindmap&#10;  root((EditorConfig))&#10;    核心定位&#10;      跨编辑器配置&#10;      基础文件格式&#10;      最小公约数&#10;    配置语法&#10;      INI 风格&#10;      Glob 文件匹配&#10;      目录层级合并&#10;    核心属性&#10;      indent_style/size&#10;      end_of_line&#10;      charset&#10;      trim_trailing_whitespace&#10;    协同策略&#10;      EditorConfig 管基础格式&#10;      Prettier 管代码格式化&#10;      ESLint 管代码质量&#10;    Monorepo 支持&#10;      层级配置&#10;      子包覆盖&#10;      root 标记控制&#10;    编辑器支持&#10;      VS Code 内置&#10;      JetBrains 内置&#10;      Vim/Sublime 插件\">mindmap\n  root((EditorConfig))\n    核心定位\n      跨编辑器配置\n      基础文件格式\n      最小公约数\n    配置语法\n      INI 风格\n      Glob 文件匹配\n      目录层级合并\n    核心属性\n      indent_style/size\n      end_of_line\n      charset\n      trim_trailing_whitespace\n    协同策略\n      EditorConfig 管基础格式\n      Prettier 管代码格式化\n      ESLint 管代码质量\n    Monorepo 支持\n      层级配置\n      子包覆盖\n      root 标记控制\n    编辑器支持\n      VS Code 内置\n      JetBrains 内置\n      Vim/Sublime 插件</pre><ul>\n<li>EditorConfig 解决的是跨编辑器的基础文件格式统一问题，是格式化工具链的底层基础设施</li>\n<li>配置采用 INI 语法 + glob 匹配，支持目录层级合并和 <code>root = true</code> 边界控制</li>\n<li>与 Prettier 形成互补：EditorConfig 管缩进和换行等基础属性，Prettier 管代码语法级格式化</li>\n<li>Monorepo 场景下利用目录层级机制为不同子包设置差异化配置</li>\n<li>主流编辑器原生或通过插件支持，但 EditorConfig 只影响编辑行为，不主动重格式化已有代码</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"EditorConfig 与编辑器统一配置","id":"editorconfig-与编辑器统一配置"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"配置语法与属性详解","id":"配置语法与属性详解"},{"level":2,"text":"文件匹配与优先级机制","id":"文件匹配与优先级机制"},{"level":2,"text":"与 Prettier 和 ESLint 的协同","id":"与-prettier-和-eslint-的协同"},{"level":2,"text":"Monorepo 场景下的配置策略","id":"monorepo-场景下的配置策略"},{"level":2,"text":"IDE 原生支持与插件生态","id":"ide-原生支持与插件生态"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"Prettier 深度解析","url":"/l-doc-books/h/editors-compilers/code-formatting-linting/formatting-principles/prettier-deep-dive"},"next":{"title":"代码格式化工具演进史","url":"/l-doc-books/h/editors-compilers/code-formatting-linting/formatting-principles/formatting-history"}}